# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in from your Supabase project's
# Settings -> API page. Also set these two as Environment Variables in the
# Vercel project (Production, Preview, and Development) before deploying.
#
# The anon key is meant to be public — it ships inside the built JS bundle.
# Row Level Security policies (see supabase/migrations/) are what actually
# keep users from reading/writing data they shouldn't, not this key's secrecy.
# Never put the Supabase service_role key in a VITE_-prefixed variable.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
